// Proposed extensions of the diffstacking work. Nothing here exists yet; the as-is elements they point at do.
model {
  proposed_diffstacking_db_merge_fallback = component 'RDF database merge fallback (slow route without files)' 'When a path of differences cannot be applied in place, the base graphs are already in the RDF database: the differences are merged there and the conversion is run again, so no original file has to be kept anywhere.'

  proposed_diffstacking_opencgmes = library 'OpenCGMES (general difference model application)' 'Third party RDF tooling that turns an arbitrary difference model into a full model (CimDatasetGraph.differenceModelToFullModel, FastDeltaGraph + CimXmlWriter). The reference the difference model file structure is validated against, and where general difference application belongs.'

  proposed_diffstacking_db_merge_fallback -> powsybl_core.cgmes.triple_store_diff_applier 'would reuse as-is'
  proposed_diffstacking_db_merge_fallback -> powsybl_core.cgmes.conversion_update 'would reuse as-is'
  proposed_diffstacking_db_merge_fallback -> powsybl_core.cgmes.cgmes_diff_import 'would be chosen by the decision function of'
  proposed_diffstacking_opencgmes -> powsybl_core.iidm.io.exchange_formats.difference_model_format 'reads and writes the same format as'
}
